@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
# Europe's first sample article
@articleId = 00000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Post a comment: the prohibited words are masked by ProfanityService
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{articleId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Christian",
  "content": "What a darn good idea, I love it!"
}

### Read the comments on the article
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{articleId}}/comments

# Circuit breaker demo:
# 1. docker compose stop profanity-service
# 2. Post a comment a few times: 503 every time, and after 3 failures the circuit opens
#    (see "Circuit OPEN" in: docker compose logs comment-service)
# 3. Reading the comments still works
# 4. docker compose start profanity-service, wait 15 seconds, post again: 201 Created
